<title>CHINA: Shanghai Forever 6-mth net falls 75%.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Forever 6-mth net falls 75%.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996 (in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	 481.645	vs	   400.472</p>
<p> Net profit	2.369	 vs	   9.379</p>
<p> Net asset per share	2.41 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.0103 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Forever Bicycle Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the figures are unaudited.</p>
</text>
